{"name":"Goodbye Kiss","hex":"#d9cac3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"goodbye","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Farewell; a formula used to another person or persons when the speaker, writer, or person addressed is departing."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An utterance of goodbye, the wishing of farewell to someone."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/goodbye"},{"term":"kiss","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To touch with the lips or press the lips against, usually to show love or affection or passion, or as part of a greeting.","To (cause to) touch lightly or slightly; to come into contact."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A touch with the lips, usually to express love or affection, or as a greeting.","An 'X' mark placed at the end of a letter or other type of message, signifying the bestowal of a kiss from the sender to the receiver."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/kiss"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Goodbye Kiss (album)","blocks":[{"text":"The Goodbye Kiss is the fifth Mandarin studio album by Hong Kong recording artist Jacky Cheung. It was released through PolyGram Records Hong Kong on 5 March 1993."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b8/The_Goodbye_Kiss_Cover_in_Japan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Goodbye_Kiss_(album)","wikidata":"Q7737308"},{"title":"Goodbye Kiss","blocks":[{"text":"\"Goodbye Kiss\" is the third single by Kasabian from their fourth studio album, Velociraptor! (2011). It was released first as a music video and then as a single A-side 10\" vinyl on 20 February 2012. It is available as a digital download. On 27 November 2011, Kasabian performed \"Goodbye Kiss\" during the BBC's Formula 1 and performed on 2011 closing season montage and on BBC's The Graham Norton Show."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/20/Kasabian_goodbye_kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodbye_Kiss","wikidata":"Q3773402"},{"title":"Kiss","blocks":[{"text":"A kiss is the touching or pressing of one's lips against another person, animal, or object. The cultural connotations associated with kissing vary significantly between different societies and contexts. Depending on the culture and circumstances, a kiss can express a wide range of emotions, such as love, passion, romance, sexual attraction, sexual arousal, affection, respect, a wish for peace or good luck, as well as numerous other meanings. In some situations, kissing takes on the function of a greeting or a ritual, formal, or symbolic gesture indicating religious devotion, institutional respect, or an act of sacramental nature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg/330px-Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiss","wikidata":"Q7307"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/1280px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A forehead kiss","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSMC-16853.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/US_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain%27s_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_%28DDG_93%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_